      <column caption='Text' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_1627206902318534658]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [Bet Position] = &quot;Player&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;To reduce the probability of casino loss below 1.0% for Player bets, a total of 32,200 bets must be placed. Currently, based on the player&apos;s bet count (&quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot;), the probability of casino loss stands at &quot; &#13;&#10;    + [Volatility] + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Banker&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;To bring the casino&apos;s loss probability under 1.0% for Banker bets, a total of 41,700 bets are required. At present, with &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Banker bets, the casino loss probability is &quot; &#13;&#10;    + [Volatility] + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Tie&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;For Tie bets, 1,835 bets must be placed to reduce the casino&apos;s loss probability below 1.0%. Currently, with &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Tie bets, the loss probability is &quot; &#13;&#10;    + [Volatility] + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Player/Banker Pair&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;For Banker Pair and Player Pair bets, a total of 5,030 bets are needed to reduce the casino&apos;s probability of loss below 1.0%. Currently, with &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Banker Pair and Player Pair bets, the probability of casino loss is &quot; &#13;&#10;    + [Volatility] + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Straight Up&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;To reduce the probability of casino loss below 1.0%, a total of 253,000 Straight Up bets must be placed. Considering the player&apos;s current bet count of (&quot;&#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed])&#13;&#10;    + &quot; bets), the probability of casino loss currently stands at &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Volatility]) + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Split&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;To reduce the probability of casino loss below 1.0% for Roulette Split bets, a total of 123,000 bets must be placed. Considering the player&apos;s current bet count of &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Split bets, the probability of casino loss currently stands at &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Volatility]) + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Even chance&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;To reduce the probability of casino loss below 1.0%, a total of 7,420 Even Chance bets must be placed. Considering the player&apos;s current bet count of &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Even Chances bets, the probability of casino loss currently stands at &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Volatility]) + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Column/Dozen&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;To reduce the probability of casino loss below 1.0%, a total of 14,650 Columns &amp; Dozens bets must be placed. Considering the player&apos;s current bet count of &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Columns &amp; Dozens bets, the probability of casino loss currently stands at &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Volatility]) + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Corner&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Based on the player&apos;s historical winnings from Corner bets, a total of 58,000 bets must be placed to reduce the probability of casino loss below 1.0%. Currently, with &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Corner bets, the probability of casino loss stands at &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Volatility]) + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Six-Line&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;In addition, based on the player&apos;s historical winnings from Roulette Six-Line bets, a total of 36,400 bets must be placed to reduce the probability of casino loss below 1.0%. Currently, with &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Six-Line bets, the probability of casino loss stands at &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Volatility]) + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Bet Position] = &quot;Street&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;To reduce the probability of casino loss below 1.0% for Roulette Street bets, a total of 79,700 bets must be placed. Considering the player&apos;s current bet count of &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Bets Placed]) &#13;&#10;    + &quot; Street bets, the probability of casino loss currently stands at &quot; &#13;&#10;    + STR([Volatility]) + &quot;.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    NULL&#13;&#10;END' />
